URL mode returns every exact match even with a finite --limit.
-- seed.json --
{"Issue": [{"identifier": "ENG-201", "title": "One", "description": "来源：https://example.com/objects/multi"}, {"identifier": "ENG-202", "title": "Two", "description": "来源：https://example.com/objects/multi"}]}
-- run --
linear issue query --all-teams --url https://example.com/objects/multi --limit 1 --json
